## Development

```bash
git clone ...

cd CNCguitarwizard

python -m venv .venv

source .venv/bin/activate
# Windows:
# .venv\Scripts\activate

python -m pip install -e .

pytest

python -m cncguitarwizard
```

## Development Setup

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate

python -m pip install --upgrade pip
python -m pip install -e .

python -m pytest
python -m cncguitarwizard
```

Run the full quality gate before completing a change:

```bash
python -m pytest
ruff check .
mypy
```

GitHub Actions runs the same pytest, Ruff, and mypy checks on every push and
pull request. Python warnings fail the test step.
